%% OpenHub -- CLI command tree (v5.1)
%% oh commands grouped by the sections of `oh --help` (checked against `oh help --all`).
%% "Deprecated" commands still work and warn (removal in v6); "Removed" names
%% only answer with their replacement and exit with code 2.

